  "text": "Then Nia mentioned that Julian had sent her the details for Friday's showcase. I think he might actually be asking me out, she said, trying and failing to sound casual. Malik released her hand and adjusted the strap of his laptop bag. You should go, he said. His voice was kind, steady, and almost completely convincing. You wanted to see the radio station. Nia studied him for half a second, then smiled. I did. They walked away from the bell together, carrying two kinds of plans into the next week, the ones they had said aloud and the ones they had not yet admitted, even to themselves.",
